@testray.main.component.name = "Support QA"
@type = "zendesk.api"

Feature: FLS JIRA Routing
	Testing the routing of specific tickets from FLS organizations to JIRA. This test will use an existing account a

Teardown:
	* I wait for "10" seconds
	* I teardown the tickets with ticketIds "${staticRequestIdList}" from zendesk.liferay.com
	* I teardown users with the following userExternalIds from zendesk.liferay.com
	| User1 |

Scenario: FLS JIRA Routing
	End users who create requests for a partner organization integrated into JIRA should have the requests with the jira_escalated tag included

	Given I create a user with the following values
	| Name             | Zendesk User1                    |
	| Tags             | osb_customer,osb_kb              |
	| Password         | zendeskqauser                    |
	| Role             | End-user                         |
	| Access           | Organization                     |
	| Email            | zendesk.user1@zendesk.com.broken |
	| Phone Number     | +1 (555) 555-5555                |
	| Organization     | Cignex - SP                      |
	| Language         | English                          |
	| Time Zone        | Pacific Time (US & Canada)       | 
	| External ID      | User1                            |
	And I create several requests as a user with the email address "zendesk.user1@zendesk.com.broken" with the following product and component values
	| prd_developer_tools         |                                        |
	| prd_enterprise_search       | security                               |
	| prd_liferay_commerce_3_0    | configuration_and_settings             |
	| prd_liferay_dxp_7_3         | app_builder                            |
	| prd_liferay_portal_6_2      | authentication                         |
	| prd_management_tools_lcs    |                                        |
	| prd_mobile_device_detection |                                        |
	| prd_mobile_experience       |                                        |
	| prd_productivity_tools_sync |                                        |
	| prd_social_office           |                                        |
	And I wait for "5" minutes
	Then the tickets with the ticketIds "${staticRequestIdList}" should contain the tag "jira_escalated"